    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "zh": "一个在文字与逻辑之间游走的人。偏爱深度思考，习惯在安静里慢慢沉淀，对世界保持好奇，也对自我保持清醒。",
        "en": "A person wandering between words and logic. Loves deep thinking, settles slowly in quietness, stays curious about the world and clear about oneself."
      },
      {
        "zh": "时而感性细腻，时而理性较真，不追逐喧嚣，只忠于内心。",
        "en": "Sometimes emotional and delicate, sometimes rational and meticulous. Not chasing noise, only loyal to the heart."
      },
      {
        "zh": "这里是我的精神自留地，记录思考、感悟与偶然的灵光一现。",
        "en": "This is my spiritual sanctuary — recording thoughts, reflections, and occasional flashes of inspiration."
      },
      {
        "zh": "不问来路，不问归途，只与同频者，慢慢相遇。",
        "en": "Not asking where I came from, not asking where I'm going — just slowly meeting those on the same frequency."
      }
